00:00:57.470 --> 00:00:59.280
And, but it's kind of a rockstar name.

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:00.360
Hudson's cool.

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:01.193
- Well, it is cool,

00:01:01.193 --> 00:01:02.210
