00:01:18.158 --> 00:01:20.530
Oh my God. Have you ever done that?

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:21.530
- I have one in my house.

00:01:21.530 --> 00:01:23.990
Not this brand, but we have a cold plunge.

00:01:23.990 --> 00:01:25.799
- Give me your address.
Give me your address,

00:01:25.799 --> 00:01:26.847
I'll send it to you.

00:01:26.847 --> 00:01:27.800
- You send me one of these?
- Yes.

00:01:27.800 --> 00:01:28.633
- Amazing.
- Yeah.

00:01:28.633 --> 00:01:32.070
