00:02:30.660 --> 00:02:32.320
But then I thought, am I that LA tool

00:02:32.320 --> 00:02:33.917
that's like I have an ice bath in my,

00:02:33.917 --> 00:02:35.390
haha I just called you a tool!

00:02:35.390 --> 00:02:36.286
