with a show. That's amazing.

00:02:55.003 --> 00:02:55.900
- [Robert] Yeah.

00:02:55.900 --> 00:02:57.540
- So why do you, and by the way,

00:02:57.540 --> 00:02:59.170
I love that Cuban was in the corner

