00:03:01.060 --> 00:03:03.320
And I'm like, hey, real
easy from the cheap seats.

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:04.963
You're like not in the ice bath.

00:03:04.963 --> 00:03:06.610
- Cuban's like that friend you have

00:03:06.610 --> 00:03:08.050
who never does anything, but always--

00:03:08.050 --> 00:03:09.030
- [Kelly] But gives you crap about yeah!

